t_p7_161","t":"Hi Aswilled,\n\nI was sleeping when that UJ went south... middle of the night you know","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#161","p":7,"im":[],"m":161},{"id":"art_p7_162","t":"Art wrote: Hi Aswilled,\n\nI was sleeping when that UJ went south... middle of the night you know\n\ni totally get it. god helps me out with that. no lie, he be showing me the market approaching the level while sleeping. then i jump up and check the market i seen and wah-lah, i'm in.","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#162","p":7,"im":[],"m":162},{"id":"art_p7_163","t":"","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#163","p":7,"im":["36d2c871f93edfd4fa6505c4c420002175d0477a","df882385de349f20bfb24c3a09e188f676e62cf6","4cbf5a2c0e0725cbe5f441cbc4cf5cdbe3d36381"],"m":163},{"id":"art_p7_164","t":"","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#164","p":7,"im":["36d2c871f93edfd4fa6505c4c420002175d0477a","df882385de349f20bfb24c3a09e188f676e62cf6","4cbf5a2c0e0725cbe5f441cbc4cf5cdbe3d36381"],"m":164},{"id":"art_p7_165","t":"","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#165","p":7,"im":["146371b28283d9cf6eb54b4730a8b8c2b9873975"],"m":165},{"id":"art_p7_166","t":"Have a trade that did not set up properly or maybe there was no trade. If you have some great ideas - shoot\n\nGBPUSD hit supply on HTF. after it pulled back formed a very nice level for FO. So was waiting for it.\n\nHere's M30:\n\nM1 of the supply. That marked flip was where expected the GU to turn.\n\nNow the approach formed a flag (red rectangle) have marked it as key area. So If price engulfs will look for short. By the time it did engulf it went south to TG. Next short was the one IF posted in his journal. So this was the A plan at the time.\n\nB plan is kind of obvious (?) after the fact. Blue rectangle is also a flag that pushed price to the flip and reacted. Then it was consumed, FTR formed.. small retrace (entry) and went for TG.\n\nDid not feel comfortable shorting it after blue demand was consumed since the original push originated in red rectangle. Feel free to share what you all think.\n\nTG:\n\nLimit sell at that M1 flip would have been best entry with easiest management","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#166","p":7,"im":["e95f53e47dad54cc630beedf3b5fd09aa035c348","94d676fd34a3878a0700e08e35c11ade5dde946f","806030186763c86bf47d9bae454828c6a7729937","9f3858fb8ad98f39026669ef36170636c99beb98"],"m":166},{"id":"art_p7_167","t":"Hello guys,\n\nI took a S/R flip trade on SP500 futures overnight and got stopped out. I stared at the chart but couldn't find out why except using W1 and MN1 trend to justify the failure. But then those TFs seem to be too far from a M15 trade. Could you guys take a look at this and help me explain?\n\nThe live chart can be accessed at www.tradingview.comusing ticker SPX500.\n\nThanks in advance!\n\nSean.","a":"Sean9henry","d":"","n":"#167","p":7,"im":["f272977f494aec2ec1fb5febe09e11df15efce58"],"m":167},{"id":"art_p7_168","t":"Idea was good. Though some information lacked on charts due to too low timeframe.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#168","p":7,"im":["44b39d6adf02f83a6fcbd7660ba73d342e545b60","afa6b5069f332188f4f2dd33dbddff37add4ce98"],"m":168},{"id":"art_p7_169","t":"Sean9henry\n\nThanks a lot, Art. That is a very good point. I apparently forced the trade a bit after seeing that extended smooth run up.\n\nAlso like to see your thoughts/comments on my next question on the chart below --- I am still evolving on that, no solid resolution yet. Of course, comments from other friends are also appreciated","a":"—","d":"","n":"#169","p":7,"im":["b72c216f7003a010da888adcd431f152dd391f05"],"m":169},{"id":"art_p7_170","t":"","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#170","p":7,"im":["d93cf914a6d51ae62d62620c977513fe1b68dcb0","39e1404e237f483b333090dce0b36569fa4c6260"],"m":170},{"id":"art_p7_171","t":"Yes that DP that made the push into supply was significant, but it was overwritten when the high it created was engulfed by the DP marked blue. so the blue then became the significant demand to be engulfed.\n\nArt wrote: Have a trade that did not set up properly or maybe there was no trade. If you have some great ideas - shoot\n\nGBPUSD hit supply on HTF. after it pulled back formed a very nice level for FO. So was waiting for it.\n\nHere's M30:","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#171","p":7,"im":["e95f53e47dad54cc630beedf3b5fd09aa035c348","94d676fd34a3878a0700e08e35c11ade5dde946f","806030186763c86bf47d9bae454828c6a7729937","9f3858fb8ad98f39026669ef36170636c99beb98"],"m":171},{"id":"art_p7_172","t":"It was overwritten. That is very scientifically put.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#172","p":7,"im":[],"m":172},{"id":"art_p7_173","t":"CADJPY short","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#173","p":7,"im":["8e83d0ca6dffee65f268488d1f2d533b1c60e98c"],"m":173},{"id":"art_p7_174","t":"Don't trade s/d trade the trend. trade the trend you see the MMs are going in at the time of your trade. it is good to watch the market for at least an hour before entering. that way you can see if the supply levels are holding or the demand levels. and it has to coincide with the HTFs levels and direction. the best levels are the ones where the daily and/or 4h level line up with every other level underneath it. then wait for the 1m engulf test, and you will have your perfect entry.\n\nSean9henry wrote: Thanks a lot, Art. That is a very good point. I apparently forced the trade a bit after seeing that extended smooth run up.\n\nAlso like to see your thoughts/comments on my next question on the chart below --- I am still evolving on that, no solid resolution yet. Of course, comments from other friends are also appreciated","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#174","p":7,"im":["b72c216f7003a010da888adcd431f152dd391f05"],"m":174},{"id":"art_p7_175","t":"Aswilled wrote: Don't trade s/d trade the trend. trade the trend you see the MMs are going in at the time of your trade. it is good to watch the market for at least an hour before entering. that way you can see if the supply levels are holding or the demand levels. and it has to coincide with the HTFs levels and direction. the best levels are the ones where the daily and/or 4h level line up with every other level underneath it. then wait for the 1m engulf test, and you will have your perfect entry.\n\nThanks, Aswilled! \"the best levels are the ones where the daily and/or 4h level line up with every other level underneath it. then wait for the 1m engulf test, and you will have your perfect entry\" = GOLD --- I need to develop patience to wait until the gold comes around, rather than keep on picking iron and get blisters on my hand\n\nSean.","a":"Sean9henry","d":"","n":"#175","p":7,"im":[],"m":175}],"images":[{"k":"a32d6a3fca38afcff0c6bb6a0d2dd1482f7ed003","t":"assets/thumbs/a32d6a3fca38afcff0c6bb6a0d2dd1482f7ed003.webp","f":"assets/images/a32d6a3fca38afcff0c6bb6a0d2dd1482f7ed003.png","w":1414,"h":700,"b":29658,"o":"a32d6a3fca38afcff0c6bb6a0d2dd1482f7ed003.png","p":7,"pid":"art_p7_159"},{"k":"4056e283c6125c10dd8e23a0965178442326778a","t":"assets/thumbs/4056e283c6125c10dd8e23a0965178442326778a.webp","f":"assets/images/4056e283c6125c10dd8e23a0965178442326778a.jpeg","w":1800,"h":867,"b":118904,"o":"4056e283c6125c10dd8e23a0965178442326778a.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"art_p7_151"},{"k":"bf6887f3ed078efb7cc208c8fdb4d51bdc2815f5","t":"assets/thumbs/bf6887f3ed078efb7cc208c8fdb4d51bdc2815f5.webp","f":"assets/images/bf6887f3ed078efb7cc208c8fdb4d51bdc2815f5.jpeg","w":1800,"h":861,"b":112172,"o":"bf6887f3ed078efb7cc208c8fdb4d51bdc2815f5.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"art_p7_151"},{"k":"461d3c884ef944671ab432ec7f89ae49219e6ce6","t":"assets/thumbs/461d3c884ef944671ab432ec7f89ae49219e6ce6.webp","f":"assets/images/461d3c884ef944671ab432ec7f89ae49219e6ce6.jpeg","w":1800,"h":866,"b":117064,"o":"461d3c884ef944671ab432ec7f89ae49219e6ce6.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"art_p7_151"},{"k":"ed82cd8dd6664317c81489f5379976a012ceb8e5","t":"assets/thumbs/ed82cd8dd6664317c81489f5379976a012ceb8e5.webp","f":"assets/images/ed82cd8dd6664317c81489f5379976a012ceb8e5.jpeg","w":1800,"h":865,"b":113291,"o":"ed82cd8dd6664317c81489f5379976a012ceb8e5.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"art_p7_151"},